	(text "J2: spare GPIO35-42. UART1 TX/RX = GPIO36/37,\nGPIO40-42 = ADC0-2. J3: SWD in a Pico's debug pin order.\nGPIO0-31 go to the four output shrouds (Outputs sheet).\nGPIO43-47 are the RM2 and the PSRAM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 335.28 213.36 0)
		(effects
